  "body": "From [crbug/1274922](https://crbug.com/1274922) it would be useful for developers if the `USBConfiguration`, `USBInterface`, `USBAlternateInterface` and `USBEndpoint` instances returned by the accessors on `USBDevice` were `===` comparable. Right now this is unspecified and Chromium returns new instances every time the attributes are accessed. This is in contrast to `USBDevice` instances themselves which are defined as returning the same instance from `requestDevice()` and `getDevices()`.",
